OL,3,ACompetition for degree apprenticeships
OL,4,Aquadruples as university costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompetition for degree apprenticeships
OL,7,Fin England has quadrupled over the past
OL,8,Fthree years, the BBC has found.
OL,10,FThe popularity of degree
OL,11,Fapprenticeships - which offer a
OL,12,Fpaid-for university degree along with a
OL,13,Fsalary - has grown as the cost of
OL,14,Funiversity has come under increased
OL,15,Fscrutiny.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
