OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACompetition for degree apprenticeships
OL,4,Aquadruples as university costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FData seen by the BBC showed the number
OL,7,Fof applicants through the government's
OL,8,Fcentral platform nearly tripled from
OL,9,F8,100 to 21,800 over the past three
OL,10,Fyears, while the number of positions
OL,11,Favailable fell by almost half, from
OL,12,F7,300 to 3,700.
OL,14,FApplicants said they applied to
OL,15,Funiversity as a "backup" because
OL,16,Fcompetition was so fierce, with
OL,17,Femployers cutting back on hiring
OL,18,Fbecause of high employment costs and
OL,19,Feconomic uncertainty.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
